"name":"List-ID","value":"<100032969.xt.local>"},{"name":"X-CSA-Complaints","value":"csa-complaints@eco.de"},{"name":"x-messageKey","value":"764243-692624129-2047245"},{"name":"X-Delivery","value":"Transactional"},{"name":"X-SFMC-Stack","value":"10"},{"name":"x-job","value":"100032969_54783"},{"name":"List-Unsubscribe","value":"<https://info.hedgeye.com/listUnsubscribeHeader/u/764243/28e5ac2768859b27e0b97984a5d8375da495f57468d52861032537bebb56fdfd/692643995>"},{"name":"List-Unsubscribe-Post","value":"List-Unsubscribe=One-Click"},{"name":"X-Report-Abuse-To","value":"abuse@pd25.com"},{"name":"Message-ID","value":"<c0089986-b1c1-4f41-8ecc-8131f7df179b@dfw1s10mta664.xt.local>"},{"name":"Feedback-ID","value":"100032969:54783:13.111.111.131:sfmktgcld"},{"name":"Content-Type","value":"multipart/alternative; boundary=\"eBy9VdJh4JQR=_?:\""}],"body":{"size":0,"base64_url_content":null,"content":null,"attachment_id":null},"read_attachment_supported":null,"parts":[{"part_id":"0","mime_type":"text/plain","filename":"","headers":[{"name":"Content-Type","value":"text/plain; charset=\"utf-8\""},{"name":"Content-Transfer-Encoding","value":"8bit"}],"body":{"size":6049,"base64_url_content":null,"content":"\r\nSix veteran Hedgeye analysts pitch Hedgeye CEO Keith McCullough one of their high-conviction stock ideas.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tView email in browser\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/webmail/764243/692643995/28e5ac2768859b27e0b97984a5d8375da495f57468d52861032537bebb56fdfd\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/e-stock-and-policy2Chedgeye-tv/z18cl6/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\r\n\r\nYesterday, Hedgeye CEO Keith McCullough hosted THE PITCH featuring 6 Hedgeye Analysts, 6 Stock Ideas, in 60 Minutes.\r\n\r\nDuring this special HedgeyeTV event, six veteran Hedgeye analysts pitched one of their high-conviction stock ideas (long or short) to our Risk-Manager-In-Chief who evaluated the set-up live.\r\n\r\nThe buyside keeps their stock picking process under lock and key… so we’re giving you an inside look at how a portfolio manager evaluates analyst ideas in real-time (and helping you find the next big winners.)\r\n\r\nTHE LINEUP:\r\n\r\n\tRetail analyst Brian McGough\r\n\r\n\tChina analyst Felix Wang\r\n\r\n\tCommunications analyst Andrew Freedman\r\n\r\n\tIndustrial analyst Jay Van Sciver\r\n\r\n\tGaming, Lodging &amp; Leisure analyst Todd Jordan\r\n\r\n\tHealthcare analyst Tom Tobin\r\n\r\n\t \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWATCH NOW\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/e-stock-and-policy2Chedgeye-tv/z18cl6/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\r\n\r\nP.S. We recently announced a brand-new Sector Pro \"create your own research bundle program\" Pick 3, Pick 5, Pick 7 Sector Pro products  Questions? Contact Danny New and Jamie Bruno at support@hedgeye.com\r\n\r\nmailto:support@hedgeye.com\r\n\r\n.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMACRO PRO EXCLUSIVE WEBCAST\r\n\r\nmailto:support@hedgeye.com?subject=Macro%20Themes%20Please!\r\n\r\nOur Founder and Risk-Manager-In-Chief Keith McCullough is hosting our highly anticipated 2Q 2022 Quarterly Macro Themes presentation this TODAY at 11AM ET. Keith will dig deep into the three big investing themes our Macro team believes will (meaningfully) drive your portfolio returns in coming months.\r\n\r\nFYI—Quarterly Macro Themes is arguably our most important offering to subscribers. For years, it was exclusively available to our Institutional subscribers. We recently opened it up to our Macro Pro subscribers.\r\n\r\nClick here to see what is included in Macro Pro.\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/bMWg2MyXVUo/z18cl9/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\r\n\r\nIcing On The Cake…\r\n\r\nHedgeye is hosting its first annual subscriber conference, Hedgeye Live, on May 12-15, 2022 at the Hyatt Regency in Greenwich, CT.. We encourage you to visit the Hedgeye Live\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/l-764243-2022-01-28-th58j7/z18cld/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\r\n\r\n website for a full rundown of what attendees can expect.\r\n\r\nHundreds of investors and Hedgeye subscribers will join our 75+ team and a coterie of the investing world’s finest as special guests for exclusive investing &amp; geopolitical discussions, private dinners in the Greenwich area, live interviews and Hedgeye shows, a tour of our Stamford, CT HQ, cocktails, live music &amp; partying at Hedgeye’s first Gala…\r\n\r\nWe’re breaking down Wall Street’s ‘old boys club’ by bringing transparency, community, and alpha-generating insights to all investors.\r\n\r\nWhen you sign-up for Macro Pro, you can get one free Hedgeye Live ticket.\r\n\r\nBottom line—purchase Macro Pro for only $6,499 (regularly priced at $7,500) and we’ll include a ticket which goes for over $3,000.\r\n\r\nThis is a (very) limited-time offer.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSubscribers who sign up will receive a pro-rated refund on their existing subscription(s). Simply sign up then reach out to support@hedgeye.com\r\n\r\nmailto:support@hedgeye.com\r\n\r\n to get your pro-rated refund.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGET MACRO PRO NOW\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/esearch-yearly-1-macro-pro-556/z18clh/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t___________\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\nABOUT HEDGEYE\r\n\r\nHedgeye Risk Management is an independent investment research and online financial media company, focused exclusively on generating and delivering thoughtful investment ideas in a proven buy-side process.  The firm combines quantitative, bottom-up and macro analysis with an emphasis on timing.  \r\n\r\nThe Hedgeye team features some of the most highly-regarded research analysts on Wall Street, covering Macro, Financials, Energy, Healthcare, Retail, Gaming, Lodging &amp; Leisure (GLL), Restaurants, Industrials, Consumer Staples, Internet &amp; Media, Housing, Materials, Technology, Demography and Washington policy analysis, including Macro, Energy, Healthcare, Telecom &amp; Media and Defense.\r\n\r\nUse of Hedgeye and any other products available through hedgeye.com\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/2022-03-31/z18cll/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\r\n\r\n are subject to our Terms of Service\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/t-d-l-xurkuhd-dlykxkyt-o-/z18clp/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\r\n\r\n and Privacy Policy\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/t-d-l-xurkuhd-dlykxkyt-b-/z18cls/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\r\n\r\n.\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/Hedgeye/z18clw/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\r\n\r\n   \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/Hedgeye-/z18clz/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\r\n\r\n   \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/iption-center-add-user-hedgeye/z18cm3/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\r\n\r\n      \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/ny-hedgeye-risk-management-llc/z18cm6/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCopyright © 2022, All rights reserved.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOur mailing address is:\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHedgeye Risk Management LLC\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1 High Ridge Park\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStamford, CT 06905\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tunsubscribe from all emails\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/unsubscribe/u/764243/28e5ac2768859b27e0b97984a5d8375da495f57468d52861032537bebb56fdfd/692643995\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n","attachment_id":null},"read_attachment_supported":null,"parts":null},{"part_id":"1","mime_type":"text/html","filename":"","headers":[{"name":"Content-Type","value":"text/html; charset=\"utf-8\""},{"name":"Content-Transfer-Encoding","value":"8bit"}],"body":{"size":30599,"base64_url_content":null,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD 