al, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 23px; text-align: left; padding: 20px;\" valign=\"top\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:17.25pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">Yesterday, Hedgeye CEO&nbsp;Keith McCullough<b>&nbsp;</b>hosted&nbsp;<b>THE PITCH featuring</b>&nbsp;<strong><i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">6 Hedgeye Analysts,&nbsp;6 Stock Ideas, in&nbsp;60 Minutes.</span></i></strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"background-image:initial\"><span style=\"background-position:initial\"><span style=\"background-size:initial\"><span style=\"background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"background-attachment:initial\"><span style=\"background-origin:initial\"><span style=\"background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\">During this special HedgeyeTV event, six veteran Hedgeye analysts pitched one of their high-conviction stock ideas (</span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#009900\">long</span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span\r\nstyle=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;or </span></span></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\">short</span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">)&nbsp;to our Risk-Manager-In-Chief&nbsp;who evaluated the set-up live.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:17.25pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">The buyside keeps their stock picking process under lock and key… so we’re giving you an inside look at how a portfolio manager evaluates analyst ideas in real-time (and helping you find the next big winners.)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px; text-align:center; margin-top:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:17.25pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#252729\">THE LINEUP:</span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"line-height:17.25pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#252729\">Retail analyst&nbsp;</span></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#339ef3\">Brian McGough</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"line-height:17.25pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#252729\">China analyst&nbsp;</span></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#339ef3\">Felix Wang</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"line-height:17.25pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#252729\">Communications analyst&nbsp;</span></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#339ef3\">Andrew Freedman</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"line-height:17.25pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#252729\">Industrial analyst<b>&nbsp;</b></span></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#339ef3\">Jay Van Sciver</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"line-height:17.25pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#252729\">Gaming, Lodging &amp; Leisure analyst&nbsp;</span></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#339ef3\">Todd Jordan</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n\t<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\"><span style=\"line-height:17.25pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#252729\">Healthcare analyst&nbsp;</span></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#339ef3\">Tom Tobin</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></span><br>\r\n\t&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\r\n\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate !important;\" width=\"300\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#349EF3;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;padding:10px 10px;border-radius:5px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;text-align:center;border:solid 1px #FFFFFF\"><a href=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/e-stock-and-policy2Chedgeye-tv/z18cl6/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\" style=\"color: rgb(52, 157, 243); text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff;\">WATCH NOW</span></a></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t</tbody>\r\n\t\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">P.S. We recently announced a brand-new Sector Pro \"create your own research bundle program\"&nbsp;Pick 3, Pick 5, Pick 7 Sector Pro products&nbsp; Questions? Contact Danny New and Jamie Bruno at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:support@hedgeye.com\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#2c99f2\">support@hedgeye.com</span></a>.</span></span></span></span></strong></div>\r\n</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr pardot-repeatable=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"left\" class=\"bodyContent\" pardot-data=\"\" pardot-region=\"body_content02\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; background: rgb(234, 234, 234); color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; text-align: left; padding: 20px;\" valign=\"top\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr pardot-repeatable=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"left\" class=\"bodyContent\" pardot-data=\"line-height:29px;link-color:#349EF3;link-underline:none;\" pardot-region=\"body_content02\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; color: rgb(52, 158, 243); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 29px; text-align: left; padding: 20px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong>MACRO PRO EXCLUSIVE WEBCAST</strong></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr pardot-repeatable=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"left\" class=\"bodyContent\" pardot-data=\"link-color:#349ef3;link-underline:underline;\" pardot-region=\"body_content01\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; text-align: left; padding: 0px 20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"mailto:support@hedgeye.com?subject=Macro%20Themes%20Please!\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"151\" src=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/l/764243/2022-03-30/yzpz3p/764243/1648693812rvZ9hgbb/2Q2022_Macro_Themes.jpg\" style=\"width: 560px; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; height: 151px;\" width=\"560\"></a></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr pardot-repeatable=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"left\" class=\"bodyContent\" pardot-data=\"line-height:23px;link-color:#2b96ed;link-underline:underline;\" pardot-region=\"body_content02\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 23px; text-align: left; padding: 20px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our Founder and Risk-Manager-In-Chief Keith McCullough is hosting our highly anticipated 2Q 2022&nbsp;<i>Quarterly Macro Themes</i>&nbsp;presentation this&nbsp;<b>TODAY at 11AM&nbsp;ET</b>. Keith will dig deep into the three big investing themes our Macro team believes will (meaningfully) drive your portfolio returns in coming months.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>FYI—<i>Quarterly Macro Themes</i>&nbsp;is arguably our most important offering to subscribers. For years, it was exclusively available to our Institutional subscribers. We recently opened it up to our&nbsp;<i>Macro Pro</i>&nbsp;subscribers.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/bMWg2MyXVUo/z18cl9/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\" style=\"color: rgb(43, 150, 237);\"><span style=\"color:#0099ff;\">Click here to see&nbsp;what is included in Macro Pro.</span></a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Icing On The Cake…</b></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Hedgeye is hosting its first annual subscriber conference,&nbsp;<i>Hedgeye Live</i>, on May 12-15, 2022 at the Hyatt Regency in Greenwich, CT.. We encourage you to visit the&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/l-764243-2022-01-28-th58j7/z18cld/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\" style=\"color: rgb(43, 150, 237);\">Hedgeye Live</a></strong>&nbsp;website&nbsp;for a full rundown of what attendees can expect.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Hundreds of investors and Hedgeye subscribers will join our 75+ team and a coterie of the investing world’s finest as special guests for exclusive investing &amp; geopolitical discussions, private dinners in the Greenwich area, live interviews and Hedgeye shows, a tour of our Stamford, CT HQ, cocktails, live music &amp; partying at Hedgeye’s first Gala…</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We’re breaking down Wall Street’s ‘old boys club’ by bringing transparency, community, and alpha-generating insights to all investors.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>When you sign-up for Macro Pro, you can&nbsp;get&nbsp;one free&nbsp;<i>Hedgeye Live&nbsp;</i>ticket.</b></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Bottom line—purchase&nbsp;<b>Macro Pro</b>&nbsp;for&nbsp;<b><i><u>only $6,499</u></i></b>&nbsp;(regularly priced at $7,500) and we’ll include a ticket which goes for over $3,000.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This is a (<i>very</i>) limited-time offer.<br>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSubscribers who sign up will receive a pro-rated refund on their existing subscription(s). Simply sign up then reach out to&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"mailto:support@hedgeye.com\" style=\"color: rgb(43, 150, 237);\">support@hedgeye.com</a></strong>&nbsp;to get your pro-rated refund.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate !important;\" width=\"300\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color:#349EF3;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;padding:10px 10px;border-radius:5px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;text-align:center;border:solid 1px #FFFFFF\"><a href=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/esearch-yearly-1-macro-pro-556/z18clh/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\" style=\"color: rgb(52, 157, 243); text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff;\">GET MACRO PRO NOW</span></a></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\">___________</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr pardot-repeatable=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"left\" class=\"bodyContent\" pardot-data=\"\" pardot-region=\"body_content02\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; background: rgb(234, 234, 234); color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; text-align: left; padding: 20px;\" valign=\"top\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr pardot-repeatable=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"left\" class=\"bodyContent\" pardot-data=\"link-color:#349EF3;\" pardot-region=\"body_content02\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; color: #505050; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; text-align: left; padding: 20px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"display: block; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 10px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64) !important; text-align: center;\"><strong>ABOUT HEDGEYE</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p lang=\"x-size-16\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Hedgeye Risk Management is an independent investment research and online financial media company, focused exclusively on generating and delivering thoughtful investment ideas in a proven buy-side process. &nbsp;The firm combines quantitative, bottom-up and macro analysis with an emphasis on timing. &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p lang=\"x-size-16\" style=\"text-align: center;\">The Hedgeye team features some of the most highly-regarded research analysts on Wall Street, covering Macro, Financials, Energy, Healthcare, Retail, Gaming, Lodging &amp; Leisure (GLL), Restaurants, Industrials, Consumer Staples, Internet &amp; Media, Housing, Materials, Technology, Demography and Washington policy analysis, including Macro, Energy, Healthcare, Telecom &amp; Media and Defense.</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p lang=\"x-size-16\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Use of Hedgeye and any other products available through&nbsp;<a href=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/2022-03-31/z18cll/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\" style=\"color: rgb(52, 158, 243);\">hedgeye.com</a>&nbsp;are subject to our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/t-d-l-xurkuhd-dlykxkyt-o-/z18clp/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\" style=\"color: rgb(52, 158, 243);\">Terms of Service</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/t-d-l-xurkuhd-dlykxkyt-b-/z18cls/692643995?h=S5ZDrTy_nqSSMcxRasfcXP9CWtb9pGGy6sAzdvqKgLM\" style=\"color: rgb(52, 158, 243);\">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- // END BODY --></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;\" valign=\"top\"><!-- BEGIN FOOTER // -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" ce